    "## Advanced JEV Engineering Techniques\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. Adaptive JEV Systems\n",
    "\n",
    "**Description**: JEV systems that dynamically adapt to input characteristics and computational constraints.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Features**:\n",
    "- Real-time adaptation\n",
    "- Resource-aware optimization\n",
    "- Context-dependent fusion strategies\n",
    "- Performance monitoring\n",
    "\n",
    "**Implementation**:\n",
    "```python\n# Adaptive JEV System\nclass AdaptiveJEVSystem:\n    def __init__(self, base_capacity=1000):\n        self.base_capacity = base_capacity\n        self.resource_monitor = ResourceMonitor()
        self.adaptation_strategies = AdaptationStrategyRegistry()
        self.performance_tracker = PerformanceTracker()
    \n    def process_input(self, input_data, constraints):\n        # Monitor available resources\n        resources = self.resource_monitor.get_current_resources()
        \n        # Select adaptation strategy\n        strategy = self.adaptation_strategies.select_strategy(\n            input_data, resources, constraints\n        )\n        \n        # Apply JEV processing with adaptation\n        result = self._apply_adapted_jev(input_data, strategy)\n        \n        # Track performance\n        self.performance_tracker.record(result)\n        \n        return result\n```"
   ]
  },
