   "source": [
    "### 2. Multi-Modal JEV Integration\n",
    "\n",
    "**Description**: Integration of multiple input modalities into unified JEV representations.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Features**:\n",
    "- Cross-modal attention\n",
    "- Unified embedding space\n",
    "- Modal balance optimization\n",
    "- Joint semantic understanding\n",
    "\n",
    "**Implementation**:\n",
    "```python\n# Multi-Modal JEV Integration\nclass MultiModalJEV:\n    def __init__(self, modal_configs):\n        self.modal_adapters = {}
        self.cross_modal_attentions = {}
        self.unified_projector = UnifiedEmbeddingSpace()
        \n        for modality, config in modal_configs.items():\n            self.modal_adapters[modality] = ModalAdapter(config)\n            self.cross_modal_attentions[modality] = CrossModalAttention(config)
    \n    def process_multimodal(self, multimodal_inputs):\n        # Encode each modality\n        modal_embeddings = {}
        for modality, inputs in multimodal_inputs.items():
            modal_embeddings[modality] = self.modal_adapters[modality].encode(inputs)
        \n        # Apply cross-modal attention\n        attended_embeddings = self._apply_cross_modal_attention(modal_embeddings)
        \n        # Project to unified space\n        unified_embedding = self.unified_projector.attend(attended_embeddings)
        \n        return unified_embedding\n```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3. JEV for RAG Enhancement\n",
    "\n",
    "**Description**: Using JEV to enhance Retrieval-Augmented Generation systems with superior context understanding.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Features**:\n",
    "- Enhanced retrieval relevance\n",
    "- Superior context compression\n",
    "- Improved semantic understanding\n",
    "- Better query-response matching\n",
    "\n",
    "**Implementation**:\n",
    "```python\n# JEV-Enhanced RAG\nclass JEVEnhancedRAG:\n    def __init__(self, document_store, llm, jev_engine):\n        self.document_store = document_store\n        self.llm = llm\n        self.jev_engine = jev_engine\n        self.retriever = JEVRetriever(document_store, jev_engine)
        self.generator = JEVGenerator(llm, jev_engine)
    \n    def retrieve_and_generate(self, query, filters=None):\n        # Enhanced retrieval using JEV\n        relevant_docs = self.retriever.retrieve(query, filters)\n        \n        # Create joint embedding context\n        context_embedding = self.jev_engine.create_context_embedding(relevant_docs)\n        \n        # Generate response with JEV optimization\n        response = self.generator.generate(query, context_embedding)\n        \n        return response\n```"
   ]
